{"id":"655903","name":"毛豆炒香干","author":"圆小π","authorId":"1365842","desc":"","cover":"images/655903/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"毛豆","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香干","amount":"适量"},{"name":"肉末","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"蒜苗","amount":"适量"},{"name":"青红椒","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"香干切丁。","img":"images/655903/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"青红椒切小块，蒜切末。","img":"images/655903/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蒜苗切段。","img":"images/655903/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"水开下入毛豆煮2分钟。","img":"images/655903/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"倒入香干烫半分钟。","img":"images/655903/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"捞出来沥干备用。","img":"images/655903/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"准备料汁，生抽，老抽，蚝油，少许盐，糖，小半碗清水搅匀。","img":"images/655903/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"油热下入肉末炒至变色，加一点料酒去腥。","img":"images/655903/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"下入青红椒和蒜末炒香。","img":"images/655903/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"倒入料汁煮开。","img":"images/655903/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入毛豆和香干翻炒1分钟。","img":"images/655903/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"加入蒜苗翻炒均匀，出锅。","img":"images/655903/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"毛豆炒香干。","img":"images/655903/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}